        "sentence": "Open Embedded Probe (OEP): turn an ESP32 / RP2040 / RP2350 board into a debug probe, target console and test fixture that hosts drive through one open protocol.",
        "paragraph": "Debug wires (RVSWD / SWIO for WCH CH32, SWD), a target console, GPIO / UART fixtures and logic capture, declared by name, under a session lock, over USB vendor bulk, HID, CDC, USB-Serial/JTAG or a UART bridge. The protocol is fixed; capabilities are declared by the probe and anyone can add their own interfaces. Specification: https://github.com/Open-Embedded-Probe/oep-spec",
